## SAGA exit criteria

SAGA-02 completes when the bounded registry and admitted gauges preserve contracts, permissions, witnesses, and ceilings, and GTOC-3 machine-checks that every carrier change has a complete lift license or typed refusal.

## Surviving obstructions

* SAGA-01 is not promoted.
* Manifest and gauge schemas are not closed.
* The Python conductor model census has not been reconciled to canonical Rust operator and contract owners.
* Cross-gauge semantic and privacy conformance tests do not exist.

* GTOC-3/S02-002 is blocked on the registry baseline and GTOC-2.
